ential.com/vespersyncdiary\">Vesper Sync Diary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/wwdc/\">WWDC</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.parc55hotel.com\">Parc 55</a></li>\n</ul>",
